This licence covers the code and documentation authored in this repository
(everything outside `tools/`). Two third-party tools are bundled unmodified
under their own licences, retained in place:

- `tools/destiny_v2/` — DESTINY v2, BSD-style licence. See
  `tools/destiny_v2/LICENSE`, `LICENSE_NVSim`, `LICENSE_CACTI3DD`, `NOTICE`.
- `tools/hycsim_reference/` — HyCSim reference model, bundled for the
  bit-exact conformance test only (not used to produce any reported result).
  See https://gitlab.com/uz-gaz/hycsim for its licence.

NVMExplorer and ChampSim are not bundled; `setup.sh` fetches them from their
own upstream repositories, each under its own licence. See `tools/README.md`.
